   "source": [
    "### Step Two: K-means Clustering\n",
    "\n",
    "#### K-means is an unsupervised machine learning algorithm which partitions data into k feature groups in N-dimensional space, where N is the number of input features. \n",
    "\n",
    "#### "
   ]
  },
